        "headline": "Hydrologic Outlook issued June 26 at 11:05AM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "description": "ESFAFG\n\n...Locations Impacted...\nWhite Mountains, Fairbanks, Chatanika and Chena Basins, Parks Hwy\ncorridor from Fairbanks to Healy, Denali National Park\n\nRain is still expected in the Interior and Denali National Park area\nthis weekend, but with much lower rainfall totals than models\ninitially suggested.  River rises are expected in conjunction with\nthis precipitation but because water levels are normal (low) these\nrises will not result high or impactful water levels.\n\nSee water.noaa.gov for cu",
